[en.FOCUS_C12_FLY_HIGHER]
Fly Higher

[en.FOCUS_C12_FLY_HIGHER_desc]
Several years ago, the Storm King’s airship left a profound impression on all of Equestria, including the legendary Pinkie Pie. By studying Pinkie Pie’s later designs for hot air balloons and combining them with emerging disciplines like aerodynamics, we can develop armed aircraft capable of high-altitude flight, dropping thousands of pounds of munitions from unexpected locations on enemy forces.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FLY_HIGHER]
飞得更高

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FLY_HIGHER_desc]
数年前，风暴大王的空艇跟整个小马利亚都留下了深刻印象，也包括传奇的小马萍琪派，通过研究萍琪派后来的热气球设计稿，同时结合空气动力学等新兴学科，我们可以研究出一些可以在高空飞行的武装飞行器，从敌军意想不到的地方扔下千磅弹药。

